<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>DIVINE Bot - Bot No Encontrado</title>
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body {
      background-color: #0f0f15;
      color: #ffffff;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .card-nobot {
      background-color: #1a1a24;
      border: 1px solid #2a2a3a;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 2.5rem;
      max-width: 500px;
      width: 90%;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .btn-invite {
      background-color: #5865f2;
      color: white;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
      transition: background-color 0.2s ease;
    }
    .btn-invite:hover {
      background-color: #4752c4;
      color: white;
    }
    .btn-back {
      color: #949ba4;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }
    .btn-back:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card-nobot">
    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">⚠️ El bot no está en este servidor</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary">Para poder configurar las opciones de <strong><%= guild.name %></strong>, primero debes invitar a DIVINE Bot a tu servidor.</p>
    
    <a href="https://discord.com/oauth2/authorize?client_id=<%= clientId %>&scope=bot&permissions=8" target="_blank" class="btn-invite">Invitar Bot al Servidor</a>
    <br>
    <a href="/dashboard" class="btn-back">← Volver al Dashboard</a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>